(1244838, 157951, 26679, '<td valign="top">The same image appears in the other live vote. And that one is mine. <br/>Do I detect a whiff of Scandinavian here?<br/> <br/>I took mine on Saturday, when the mist dropped below the hills it was a lovely afternoon. Except when I though the storm over Cheltenham was coming our way.<br/> <br/>The Little girl capture the emotion well here, and of course the tower as ever is gorgeous.<br/> <br/>Good Capture<br/></td>', 'The same image appears in the other live vote. And that one is mine. Do I detect a whiff of Scandinavian here? I took mine on Saturday, when the mist dropped below the hills it was a lovely afternoon. Except when I though the storm over Cheltenham was coming our way. The Little girl capture the emotion well here, and of course the tower as ever is gorgeous. Good Capture', '2005-03-23 06:56:38.000000', NULL, 1),
