(1245419, 158502, 35044, '<td valign="top">37 Down - should be "Stack". 38 Down is "Horne".  Not sure about 39 Down.<br/> <br/>A cryptic crossword would be more interesting.<br/> <br/>Nice photo, though!  A tighter crop might have been interesting - the picture is very focussed on the central elements, though I think that it is well bordered by good use of DoF.</td>', '37 Down - should be "Stack". 38 Down is "Horne".  Not sure about 39 Down. A cryptic crossword would be more interesting. Nice photo, though!  A tighter crop might have been interesting - the picture is very focussed on the central elements, though I think that it is well bordered by good use of DoF.', '2005-03-23 12:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1245434, 157342, 35044, '<td valign="top">Pandering to stereotypes of boring books, but I like the idea!  Also very well executed - how do you keep your glasses so clean?  Background might be considered a bit distracting, but I like it - not a "stock" style with zero background, but adds colour without being too much I think.  Only criticism is that you appear to have a dead pixel in centre of white area on book.</td>', 'Pandering to stereotypes of boring books, but I like the idea!  Also very well executed - how do you keep your glasses so clean?  Background might be considered a bit distracting, but I like it - not a "stock" style with zero background, but adds colour without being too much I think.  Only criticism is that you appear to have a dead pixel in centre of white area on book.', '2005-03-23 12:44:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1245435, 156819, 34217, '<td valign="top">it kinda looks like tom</td>', 'it kinda looks like tom', '2005-03-23 12:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
