(1245442, 156806, 35044, '<td valign="top">too small and badly lit. Has a certain "web-cam" feel to it.  But I don''t think that adds to the theme here.  Maybe some more lights from other directions, or more daylight?  Or even something like a candle to add mood and an interesting light effect.</td>', 'too small and badly lit. Has a certain "web-cam" feel to it.  But I don''t think that adds to the theme here.  Maybe some more lights from other directions, or more daylight?  Or even something like a candle to add mood and an interesting light effect.', '2005-03-23 12:48:49.000000', NULL, 1),
