(1245473, 159009, 35044, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea - very appropriate for the site.  A shame that the camera dial is not a little cleaner, or that the focus (literally and compositionally) is not clearly on the "P" part of the selection knob.</td>', 'Excellent idea - very appropriate for the site.  A shame that the camera dial is not a little cleaner, or that the focus (literally and compositionally) is not clearly on the "P" part of the selection knob.', '2005-03-23 12:56:12.000000', NULL, 1),
