(1245479, 158134, 30608, '<td valign="top">Very nice CANDID shot. I often think of homeless people and the emptiness and boredom they live with on a daily basis. Guess it''s a heart thing I have for people. 10</td>', 'Very nice CANDID shot. I often think of homeless people and the emptiness and boredom they live with on a daily basis. Guess it''s a heart thing I have for people. 10', '2005-03-23 12:58:03.000000', NULL, 1),
