(1246271, 157308, 34887, '<td valign="top">Now this is a refreshing "bored" photo! Very well shot and not the usual stuff. Maybe because it reminds me of when I was bored as a kid, maybe I see my kids doing the same thing, but you have really captured an emotion...a moment. It doesn''t look staged really either. Good job.</td>', 'Now this is a refreshing "bored" photo! Very well shot and not the usual stuff. Maybe because it reminds me of when I was bored as a kid, maybe I see my kids doing the same thing, but you have really captured an emotion...a moment. It doesn''t look staged really either. Good job.', '2005-03-23 17:44:25.000000', NULL, 1),
