(1246297, 157271, 34887, '<td valign="top">This I like. I can relate to this photo. Waiting for your folks to get done doing "parent" stuff can be excruciatingly boring. Well composed, body language on the daughter is priceless and the father not noticing his fathers boredom really completes this picture. Well done.</td>', 'This I like. I can relate to this photo. Waiting for your folks to get done doing "parent" stuff can be excruciatingly boring. Well composed, body language on the daughter is priceless and the father not noticing his fathers boredom really completes this picture. Well done.', '2005-03-23 17:54:24.000000', NULL, 1),
