(1246712, 156806, 32672, '<td valign="top">The skin tone is kinda overexposed.  A tip I was told:  When the main element in a picture is a person (or people), always develop the picture (or adjust, with digital stuff) for the skin tone, and the rest will look fine.  PErhaps even if you had diffused the light a bit a wouldn''t have looked so harsh on her skin.</td>', 'The skin tone is kinda overexposed.  A tip I was told:  When the main element in a picture is a person (or people), always develop the picture (or adjust, with digital stuff) for the skin tone, and the rest will look fine.  PErhaps even if you had diffused the light a bit a wouldn''t have looked so harsh on her skin.', '2005-03-23 20:05:35.000000', NULL, 1),
