(1247141, 157665, 10261, '<td valign="top">Is it the bear that is bored? If I played photographic pictionary with this image, one of my first guesses would have been "engrossed"; guessing "bored" would have come much, much later. If the bear had (visible) eyes I''d have had more queues to go on. If the bear had been reading "Quantum Physics Quarterly" or "Government Accountant''s Weekly Digest" I would have also been encouraged to see boredom.</td>', 'Is it the bear that is bored? If I played photographic pictionary with this image, one of my first guesses would have been "engrossed"; guessing "bored" would have come much, much later. If the bear had (visible) eyes I''d have had more queues to go on. If the bear had been reading "Quantum Physics Quarterly" or "Government Accountant''s Weekly Digest" I would have also been encouraged to see boredom.', '2005-03-23 23:29:33.000000', NULL, 1),
