(1247146, 158700, 10261, '<td valign="top">Doing dishes may be boring, but this picture doesn''t depict boredom. The scene is rather cluttered, which typically is a bad thing in a photograph.</td>', 'Doing dishes may be boring, but this picture doesn''t depict boredom. The scene is rather cluttered, which typically is a bad thing in a photograph.', '2005-03-23 23:31:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1247153, 157129, 10261, '<td valign="top">The background is needlessly busy; a shallower DOF would have made this a cleaner shot. The b&amp;w and grainy texture was a nice choice, as was the all-black attire. The sloppily-worn hat conveys a sense of ennui, but the facial expression seems more staged than sincere. The chin-in-hand pose does convey boredom, but it''s rather trite; since you don''t re-introduce interest by shooting it from a novel angle or anything, it''s roughly as interesting and original as a frowning face in a "sadness" themed challenge.</td>', 'The background is needlessly busy; a shallower DOF would have made this a cleaner shot. The b&w and grainy texture was a nice choice, as was the all-black attire. The sloppily-worn hat conveys a sense of ennui, but the facial expression seems more staged than sincere. The chin-in-hand pose does convey boredom, but it''s rather trite; since you don''t re-introduce interest by shooting it from a novel angle or anything, it''s roughly as interesting and original as a frowning face in a "sadness" themed challenge.', '2005-03-23 23:38:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1247159, 158503, 10261, '<td valign="top">I don''t see boredom in this photograph. The bright colors work against you here, suggesting that the mood is rather light. I can''t see the smoking man''s eyes, but his posture and the angle of his head suggest that he''s concentrating intently on something, not bored. The DOF is decent, but I''d have preferred to see a blurrier background. The water bottle on the left is somewhat distracting.</td>', 'I don''t see boredom in this photograph. The bright colors work against you here, suggesting that the mood is rather light. I can''t see the smoking man''s eyes, but his posture and the angle of his head suggest that he''s concentrating intently on something, not bored. The DOF is decent, but I''d have preferred to see a blurrier background. The water bottle on the left is somewhat distracting.', '2005-03-23 23:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1247160, 157351, 32997, '<td valign="top">ha! way to go...</td>', 'ha! way to go...', '2005-03-23 23:43:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1247161, 158731, 33047, '<td valign="top">pretty colors, interesting lady, but she doesn''t look too bored</td>', 'pretty colors, interesting lady, but she doesn''t look too bored', '2005-03-23 23:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1247162, 158465, 10261, '<td valign="top">I don''t see boredom here. Laziness? Definitely. Fatigue? Yes. Boredom? No. The photo is good from a technical standpoint (good focus, reasonable exposure of the black cat, etc.), but there''s little here to separate this image from the dozens of other zoo/house pet pictures.</td>', 'I don''t see boredom here. Laziness? Definitely. Fatigue? Yes. Boredom? No. The photo is good from a technical standpoint (good focus, reasonable exposure of the black cat, etc.), but there''s little here to separate this image from the dozens of other zoo/house pet pictures.', '2005-03-23 23:45:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1247163, 158556, 10261, '<td valign="top">This cat looks annoyed and sleepy, not bored.</td>', 'This cat looks annoyed and sleepy, not bored.', '2005-03-23 23:45:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1247167, 156884, 33047, '<td valign="top">that''s how my fiance and I fell in love, stacking glasses.  long story, but on average, yeah, people usually only stack glasses if theyre bored.</td>', 'that''s how my fiance and I fell in love, stacking glasses.  long story, but on average, yeah, people usually only stack glasses if theyre bored.', '2005-03-23 23:49:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1247168, 158723, 10261, '<td valign="top">Even if I accept the anthropomorphic premise that this plant is bored, I can''t see it in this image. He''s standing tall and proud, wearing his majestic crown, surveying the vast domain that lies below him, stretching as far as the eye can see.</td>', 'Even if I accept the anthropomorphic premise that this plant is bored, I can''t see it in this image. He''s standing tall and proud, wearing his majestic crown, surveying the vast domain that lies below him, stretching as far as the eye can see.', '2005-03-23 23:49:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1247171, 157854, 10261, '<td valign="top">This panda looks happy and lazy, not bored. This is a good stock picture of a panda, but it doesn''t meet the challenge.</td>', 'This panda looks happy and lazy, not bored. This is a good stock picture of a panda, but it doesn''t meet the challenge.', '2005-03-23 23:51:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1247174, 158446, 10261, '<td valign="top">These bizarre facial modifications may be the result of boredom, but I''m having trouble seeing boredom actually depicted here.</td>', 'These bizarre facial modifications may be the result of boredom, but I''m having trouble seeing boredom actually depicted here.', '2005-03-23 23:53:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1247175, 157203, 33047, '<td valign="top">background is distracting, even though aquariums are cool.  you could have tied it in as an intersting part of the picture, but along with laundry, chips, and shoeboxes, it''s all lost.</td>', 'background is distracting, even though aquariums are cool.  you could have tied it in as an intersting part of the picture, but along with laundry, chips, and shoeboxes, it''s all lost.', '2005-03-23 23:53:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1247176, 157271, 6668, '<td valign="top">Very nice, I like the sepia tones adds "depth" to the picture...nicely done. Good luck! 10</td>', 'Very nice, I like the sepia tones adds "depth" to the picture...nicely done. Good luck! 10', '2005-03-23 23:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1247179, 158128, 10261, '<td valign="top">This person looks sincerely bored. From a technical perspective the picture lacks interest (even to the extent that images with this theme can be interesting). This shot looks like something which anyone with a point and shoot camera could capture dozens of times per day with little effort. There''s nothing about it which suggests any real planning or skill in execution. If some of the clutter on the desk were cropped out this would make a decent (though boring) candid.</td>', 'This person looks sincerely bored. From a technical perspective the picture lacks interest (even to the extent that images with this theme can be interesting). This shot looks like something which anyone with a point and shoot camera could capture dozens of times per day with little effort. There''s nothing about it which suggests any real planning or skill in execution. If some of the clutter on the desk were cropped out this would make a decent (though boring) candid.', '2005-03-23 23:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1247182, 158909, 10261, '<td valign="top">The pole is bored? That''s too much of a stretch. A decent sunset, but far off topic.</td>', 'The pole is bored? That''s too much of a stretch. A decent sunset, but far off topic.', '2005-03-23 23:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
