(1247380, 158907, 29474, '<td valign="top">Enter your comment here%</td>', 'Enter your comment here%', '2005-03-24 06:27:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1247384, 158848, 35044, '<td valign="top">Lighting appears a bit "top down" - good shadows at the bottom, but the colours are maybe a little subdued on the sides.  Good photo though, and a nice idea for the challenge.  "Bored" (or maybe frustration) might have been better coveyed by a Rubik''s cube with the labels picked off, but that would have been less aesthetically pleasing (and would have ruined your toy).</td>', 'Lighting appears a bit "top down" - good shadows at the bottom, but the colours are maybe a little subdued on the sides.  Good photo though, and a nice idea for the challenge.  "Bored" (or maybe frustration) might have been better coveyed by a Rubik''s cube with the labels picked off, but that would have been less aesthetically pleasing (and would have ruined your toy).', '2005-03-24 06:37:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1247386, 158867, 35044, '<td valign="top">Nice image.  Seems to be a bit of ghosting on your model''s finger. Very sharp for what seems to be a long exposure.  Interesting lighting.  Not an out and out "bored" message, but I get the idea!</td>', 'Nice image.  Seems to be a bit of ghosting on your model''s finger. Very sharp for what seems to be a long exposure.  Interesting lighting.  Not an out and out "bored" message, but I get the idea!', '2005-03-24 06:39:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1247389, 158535, 35044, '<td valign="top">Very subtle - and a nice image. One of my favourites from this challenge.</td>', 'Very subtle - and a nice image. One of my favourites from this challenge.', '2005-03-24 06:40:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1247394, 158883, 35044, '<td valign="top">Bored - but still working.  Maybe needs a few elastic band balls, screwed up papers, doodles and paperclip art to get to bored!  However, I really like the image and the angle of the picture.  Simple but effective lighting.  Good cat shadow.</td>', 'Bored - but still working.  Maybe needs a few elastic band balls, screwed up papers, doodles and paperclip art to get to bored!  However, I really like the image and the angle of the picture.  Simple but effective lighting.  Good cat shadow.', '2005-03-24 06:43:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1247395, 157227, 16488, '<td valign="top">Crisp composition!  Like the choice of B&amp;W and the vignetting.  Never heard the expression in your title before...but you''ve met the challenge well.</td>', 'Crisp composition!  Like the choice of B&W and the vignetting.  Never heard the expression in your title before...but you''ve met the challenge well.', '2005-03-24 06:45:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1247396, 158727, 35044, '<td valign="top">Nice pic.  Could do with fractional sharpening (very light softening around your subject''s face, in particular).</td>', 'Nice pic.  Could do with fractional sharpening (very light softening around your subject''s face, in particular).', '2005-03-24 06:45:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1247399, 156857, 16488, '<td valign="top">Liquid blue!  Interesting abstraction.  Love the blue.  The border is a bit over-done for my tastes--but not too obnoxious.  As for fitting the challenge?....and I''m giving a lot of latitude.</td>', 'Liquid blue!  Interesting abstraction.  Love the blue.  The border is a bit over-done for my tastes--but not too obnoxious.  As for fitting the challenge?....and I''m giving a lot of latitude.', '2005-03-24 06:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1247402, 158624, 16488, '<td valign="top">Triangular!  Composition is strong.  The sunset red on the tan skin comes off as a bit too orange, though.  Stretching the challenge topic, but didn''t we all?</td>', 'Triangular!  Composition is strong.  The sunset red on the tan skin comes off as a bit too orange, though.  Stretching the challenge topic, but didn''t we all?', '2005-03-24 06:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1247404, 157144, 16488, '<td valign="top">Caught in mid-air!  Choice of hat is excellent--other props, not so much.  I think your idea for the challenge is good, but the lackluster background, the harsh shadow from the flash cast against the subject''s hand....If you removed everything except the hat and the cards, what would you lose?</td>', 'Caught in mid-air!  Choice of hat is excellent--other props, not so much.  I think your idea for the challenge is good, but the lackluster background, the harsh shadow from the flash cast against the subject''s hand....If you removed everything except the hat and the cards, what would you lose?', '2005-03-24 06:54:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1247410, 158927, 16488, '<td valign="top">Stoned on TV!  You have epitomized the look of boredom!  It is the rolled eyes, the vacant stare, the uncomfortable posture that is frozen in space--so despondent one can''t even imagine moving.<br/> <br/>If this were advanced editing, I''m sure you would have done something about the over exposed hand and the loss of detail in the shadows areound the neck .  Otherwise, technically very nice--good tecture, B&amp;W appropriately chosen.  9</td>', 'Stoned on TV!  You have epitomized the look of boredom!  It is the rolled eyes, the vacant stare, the uncomfortable posture that is frozen in space--so despondent one can''t even imagine moving. If this were advanced editing, I''m sure you would have done something about the over exposed hand and the loss of detail in the shadows areound the neck .  Otherwise, technically very nice--good tecture, B&W appropriately chosen.  9', '2005-03-24 06:59:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1247413, 158923, 16488, '<td valign="top">Seductress with a cigarette?  She''s got way too much attitude to be bored or boring.<br/> <br/>Interesting environmental portrait.  It feels washed out--would be nice if the black of the eyese was actually blacke.  Strangely tipped hoizon makes me wonder....</td>', 'Seductress with a cigarette?  She''s got way too much attitude to be bored or boring. Interesting environmental portrait.  It feels washed out--would be nice if the black of the eyese was actually blacke.  Strangely tipped hoizon makes me wonder....', '2005-03-24 07:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1247420, 157590, 16488, '<td valign="top">Looks like you and your camera were the most interesting thing around. ;)<br/>Subject is good.  I like the detail in the fur.  Lighting is fortunate.  However, something about the whole seems off.  It feels tipped to me--maybe it''s because of the empty spaces.....or the angle of your composition....or maybe I should put my glasses on and correct my astigmatism?</td>', 'Looks like you and your camera were the most interesting thing around. ;)Subject is good.  I like the detail in the fur.  Lighting is fortunate.  However, something about the whole seems off.  It feels tipped to me--maybe it''s because of the empty spaces.....or the angle of your composition....or maybe I should put my glasses on and correct my astigmatism?', '2005-03-24 07:15:43.000000', NULL, 1),
