(1247714, 158895, 14773, '<td valign="top">I love these kinds of shots, except the blur is a bit to heavy...to the point where I can''t make-out anything other than I''m assuming there''s a person and a lamp. lol I still like it. 6</td>', 'I love these kinds of shots, except the blur is a bit to heavy...to the point where I can''t make-out anything other than I''m assuming there''s a person and a lamp. lol I still like it. 6', '2005-03-24 11:52:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1247715, 156819, 10261, '<td valign="top">This is an amusing image. It''s one of the few pictures that''s dead-on topic. Still, I''m not sure how well this would work if the viewer isn''t familiar with the movie that the image alludes to.<br/> <br/>The pigmentation on the model''s chest looks overly two-dimensional. The shot is obviously done on a rather low budget, but you seem to make good use of what''s there. This is one of the better concepts in the challenge.</td>', 'This is an amusing image. It''s one of the few pictures that''s dead-on topic. Still, I''m not sure how well this would work if the viewer isn''t familiar with the movie that the image alludes to. The pigmentation on the model''s chest looks overly two-dimensional. The shot is obviously done on a rather low budget, but you seem to make good use of what''s there. This is one of the better concepts in the challenge.', '2005-03-24 11:53:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1247717, 158927, 34729, '<td valign="top">great shot.  i would have liked it more if his face was in better focus.  maybe different lighting too</td>', 'great shot.  i would have liked it more if his face was in better focus.  maybe different lighting too', '2005-03-24 11:54:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1247721, 158686, 14773, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you''ll get all the same comments: "looks like a snapshot" "the shadows are too harsh" "it''s overexposed in parts and underexposed in others". In short, you used a point and shoot camera with an onboard flash, right?  That''ll kill you every time!</td>', 'I''m sure you''ll get all the same comments: "looks like a snapshot" "the shadows are too harsh" "it''s overexposed in parts and underexposed in others". In short, you used a point and shoot camera with an onboard flash, right?  That''ll kill you every time!', '2005-03-24 11:55:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1247727, 158867, 10261, '<td valign="top">The odd illumination of the model''s eye is a bit distracting, as are the odd time lag artifacts resulting from the long/multiple exposure (model''s right hand going through one of the cards, model''s eyes oddly askew). I''d say that the theme is a bit closer to tedium than boredom, but still a solid entry.</td>', 'The odd illumination of the model''s eye is a bit distracting, as are the odd time lag artifacts resulting from the long/multiple exposure (model''s right hand going through one of the cards, model''s eyes oddly askew). I''d say that the theme is a bit closer to tedium than boredom, but still a solid entry.', '2005-03-24 11:58:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1247729, 158933, 33982, '<td valign="top">my wife fell over laughing at this one ...</td>', 'my wife fell over laughing at this one ...', '2005-03-24 12:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
