(1247736, 157342, 33982, '<td valign="top">but it sure made sleeping easier ... <br/>   --I like the background &amp; colors &amp; highligt on the frame <br/>though this may not mean much to people who have not read (attemped)  Ulises</td>', 'but it sure made sleeping easier ...    --I like the background & colors & highligt on the frame though this may not mean much to people who have not read (attemped)  Ulises', '2005-03-24 12:03:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1247740, 157914, 10261, '<td valign="top">The close cropping of this image is what sets it apart from the other ''primates looking bored'' images. I find the stray hairs in his eyebrow a bit distracting, particularly since their proximity to the edge of the frame highlights them. I think I see some subtle compression artifacts, particularly around his eyebrow and eyelashes; you may want to check the image compression settings on your camera.</td>', 'The close cropping of this image is what sets it apart from the other ''primates looking bored'' images. I find the stray hairs in his eyebrow a bit distracting, particularly since their proximity to the edge of the frame highlights them. I think I see some subtle compression artifacts, particularly around his eyebrow and eyelashes; you may want to check the image compression settings on your camera.', '2005-03-24 12:04:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1247762, 158979, 34729, '<td valign="top">i love the use of color and texture.  i''m not sure how well it depicts boredom (although after I''ve been painting for a while, this is how I start to paint), but i loved it too much to give it anything less than a 9</td>', 'i love the use of color and texture.  i''m not sure how well it depicts boredom (although after I''ve been painting for a while, this is how I start to paint), but i loved it too much to give it anything less than a 9', '2005-03-24 12:23:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1247777, 158905, 34729, '<td valign="top">the composition feels a little weak.  at first glance it looks like you didn''t try.  but as i look at it to try to come up with constructive comments, I''m starting to like it a little  more.  it makes me feel bored, but there is enough interesting detail to keep me engaged.</td>', 'the composition feels a little weak.  at first glance it looks like you didn''t try.  but as i look at it to try to come up with constructive comments, I''m starting to like it a little  more.  it makes me feel bored, but there is enough interesting detail to keep me engaged.', '2005-03-24 12:32:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1247794, 158180, 16488, '<td valign="top">Nice slice of life!  I like this composition.  I think the cast adds to the "story" behind the photo.  It would be nice to see the hand poised to make a play, it would add, I think.  The watch face is distracting because of its over-exposure.  Unfortunately, basic editing limits the potential for some obvious fixes.</td>', 'Nice slice of life!  I like this composition.  I think the cast adds to the "story" behind the photo.  It would be nice to see the hand poised to make a play, it would add, I think.  The watch face is distracting because of its over-exposure.  Unfortunately, basic editing limits the potential for some obvious fixes.', '2005-03-24 12:39:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1247796, 158839, 16488, '<td valign="top">What a sad puppy!  Much to interest the eye in this image.  The mood conveys well.  Would be nice if the one eye weren''t so obscured, though.</td>', 'What a sad puppy!  Much to interest the eye in this image.  The mood conveys well.  Would be nice if the one eye weren''t so obscured, though.', '2005-03-24 12:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1247805, 157892, 16488, '<td valign="top">Ahh, the remains of boredom!  Interestingly composed.  Like the idea/subject.  The pen keeps drawing attention unecessarily--perhaps if it were differently oriented, or the keyboard joined it in being out of focus?</td>', 'Ahh, the remains of boredom!  Interestingly composed.  Like the idea/subject.  The pen keeps drawing attention unecessarily--perhaps if it were differently oriented, or the keyboard joined it in being out of focus?', '2005-03-24 12:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1247816, 158120, 16488, '<td valign="top">Nice owl shot.  Lucky you to have seen what appears to be a great horned owl in person!  The detail in the feathers is just lovely.  Did you stretch the challenge topic a bit?  I think so.  But I can''t blame you for wanting to show this off.  It would, of course, be more perfect without the upright branch, if you could have just gotten a little different perspective on it...</td>', 'Nice owl shot.  Lucky you to have seen what appears to be a great horned owl in person!  The detail in the feathers is just lovely.  Did you stretch the challenge topic a bit?  I think so.  But I can''t blame you for wanting to show this off.  It would, of course, be more perfect without the upright branch, if you could have just gotten a little different perspective on it...', '2005-03-24 12:45:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1247821, 157850, 16488, '<td valign="top">Nicely acted!  Love the charicature of boredom!  Not a big fan of sepia, but it seems well applied in this case.</td>', 'Nicely acted!  Love the charicature of boredom!  Not a big fan of sepia, but it seems well applied in this case.', '2005-03-24 12:47:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1247825, 158556, 16488, '<td valign="top">Lovely portrait of a cat!  The blue in the eye is delicate.  Nice rendering of the fur.  He''s just pretending to be bored, though.  That''s what cats do to get what they want. :)</td>', 'Lovely portrait of a cat!  The blue in the eye is delicate.  Nice rendering of the fur.  He''s just pretending to be bored, though.  That''s what cats do to get what they want. :)', '2005-03-24 12:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1247830, 157412, 34729, '<td valign="top">i love the concept and use of color.  there is something that is stopping me from falling in love with it.  i''m sorry i can''t articulate my feeling very well (i''m new to photography), but it may be that i want the bike to be a little bit more in focus (i have no idea how you would do that).  or maybe there should have been more space around the bike to suggest all the places the bike could go if not for the rain.</td>', 'i love the concept and use of color.  there is something that is stopping me from falling in love with it.  i''m sorry i can''t articulate my feeling very well (i''m new to photography), but it may be that i want the bike to be a little bit more in focus (i have no idea how you would do that).  or maybe there should have been more space around the bike to suggest all the places the bike could go if not for the rain.', '2005-03-24 12:50:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1247831, 157922, 16488, '<td valign="top">Ho hum...(in a good way).  The expression is perfect!  The bleak, yet graphically interesting environment works well to enhance your subject and theme.  Wonder what this would look like in B&amp;W.  I''d like to see more detail in the clothes, though.  With the few bright details in the bottom left corner, my eye wants to see some definition of fabric folds.</td>', 'Ho hum...(in a good way).  The expression is perfect!  The bleak, yet graphically interesting environment works well to enhance your subject and theme.  Wonder what this would look like in B&W.  I''d like to see more detail in the clothes, though.  With the few bright details in the bottom left corner, my eye wants to see some definition of fabric folds.', '2005-03-24 12:51:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1247834, 158887, 16488, '<td valign="top">Contemplative!  Nice silhouette.  The sky is well rendered.  Compostion quite sound.  I feel you''re pushing the challenge topic, but the image is still worthy.</td>', 'Contemplative!  Nice silhouette.  The sky is well rendered.  Compostion quite sound.  I feel you''re pushing the challenge topic, but the image is still worthy.', '2005-03-24 12:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
