(1247844, 157342, 29557, '<td valign="top">good shot, the focus through the glasses is always an eye catcher (no pun intended). i think it would have been a bit better if it was sitting on a table instead of a material.</td>', 'good shot, the focus through the glasses is always an eye catcher (no pun intended). i think it would have been a bit better if it was sitting on a table instead of a material.', '2005-03-24 12:56:29.000000', NULL, 1),
