(1248392, 156935, 16488, '<td valign="top">Setting aside the challenge topic for a moment... skulls can be interesting.<br/>I think your choice of background detracts--and none of that, "but that''s where I found it" stuff--it''s dead, you can move it.  The lighting is flat, there''s nothing in the light to help sculpt the 3-dimensional nature of your subject.  This could benefit from cropping as well--as is, your subject just might be the grass.<br/>Now, the challenge topic, do I really have to tell you you''re pushing it?  Funny, though.  You''ll find a good use for your sense of humor and quirky way of seeing the world in future challenges, I''m sure.</td>', 'Setting aside the challenge topic for a moment... skulls can be interesting.I think your choice of background detracts--and none of that, "but that''s where I found it" stuff--it''s dead, you can move it.  The lighting is flat, there''s nothing in the light to help sculpt the 3-dimensional nature of your subject.  This could benefit from cropping as well--as is, your subject just might be the grass.Now, the challenge topic, do I really have to tell you you''re pushing it?  Funny, though.  You''ll find a good use for your sense of humor and quirky way of seeing the world in future challenges, I''m sure.', '2005-03-24 19:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
