(1248603, 157299, 15811, '<td valign="top">Well, he definately looks bored...I''ll give you that.  I assume the soft focus on the eyes was intentional -- but there''s a reason that it''s a general rule to focus on the eye -- because that is the part of the photo that is going to hold the most interest -- the viewer''s focal point.  Everything else should just build itself around that.  Good shot...just a little more thought and I think you''d do much better.</td>', 'Well, he definately looks bored...I''ll give you that.  I assume the soft focus on the eyes was intentional -- but there''s a reason that it''s a general rule to focus on the eye -- because that is the part of the photo that is going to hold the most interest -- the viewer''s focal point.  Everything else should just build itself around that.  Good shot...just a little more thought and I think you''d do much better.', '2005-03-24 22:00:04.000000', NULL, 1),
