(1248744, 157274, 26839, '<td valign="top">I really like this idea and gave it my highest score.  The following is meant constructively:<br/>1. The "mouse pointer" is slightly translucent which distracts the eye and betrays the shot.<br/>2. The top-left of the shot seems poorly lit.<br/>3. Would have gone with a brighter green background to better emulate the computer version.  Something like the green felt on a casino table.<br/>4. Might have made the shot 640x480, or something in the 4:3 ratio... again to better emulate the way it looks on a computer.<br/> <br/></td>', 'I really like this idea and gave it my highest score.  The following is meant constructively:1. The "mouse pointer" is slightly translucent which distracts the eye and betrays the shot.2. The top-left of the shot seems poorly lit.3. Would have gone with a brighter green background to better emulate the computer version.  Something like the green felt on a casino table.4. Might have made the shot 640x480, or something in the 4:3 ratio... again to better emulate the way it looks on a computer. ', '2005-03-24 23:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
