(1249235, 158499, 23053, '<td valign="top">One of the best in the challenge...well done.</td>', 'One of the best in the challenge...well done.', '2005-03-25 09:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1249237, 158623, 23053, '<td valign="top">Next time try a different angle or perspective.  There isn''t much to look at in this shot...nowhere for the eye to rest.  I understand what you are trying to convey but would not have picked up on the idea had I seen this photo outside of the bounds of the challenge and without the title.</td>', 'Next time try a different angle or perspective.  There isn''t much to look at in this shot...nowhere for the eye to rest.  I understand what you are trying to convey but would not have picked up on the idea had I seen this photo outside of the bounds of the challenge and without the title.', '2005-03-25 09:11:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1249241, 158120, 23053, '<td valign="top">Why would this shot convey boredom?  Don''t get me wrong - technically this shot is superb, and if entered in a wildlife challenge, it would do well.  I think the look of this owl is the opposite of boredom - it looks tense and focused.</td>', 'Why would this shot convey boredom?  Don''t get me wrong - technically this shot is superb, and if entered in a wildlife challenge, it would do well.  I think the look of this owl is the opposite of boredom - it looks tense and focused.', '2005-03-25 09:14:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1249242, 158201, 23053, '<td valign="top">This seems like a late entry for the ''Best Friends'' challenge.  It is an interesting subject and a good shot technically, but not a good fit for the boredom challenge.</td>', 'This seems like a late entry for the ''Best Friends'' challenge.  It is an interesting subject and a good shot technically, but not a good fit for the boredom challenge.', '2005-03-25 09:15:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1249247, 158943, 23053, '<td valign="top">If you saw this shot without its title, what would come to mind?  Aside from that, there is no focus for this image, not to say that the camera was out of focus, but there is nothing that draws the eye to a point.  To reuse a critique I received on the light on white challenge, it looks rather like a background photograph for a brochure - something that is used to pep up an article about food.</td>', 'If you saw this shot without its title, what would come to mind?  Aside from that, there is no focus for this image, not to say that the camera was out of focus, but there is nothing that draws the eye to a point.  To reuse a critique I received on the light on white challenge, it looks rather like a background photograph for a brochure - something that is used to pep up an article about food.', '2005-03-25 09:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1249250, 158872, 23053, '<td valign="top">Why would this shot convey boredom?  If seen outside the challenge and without the title, would people think of boredom?</td>', 'Why would this shot convey boredom?  If seen outside the challenge and without the title, would people think of boredom?', '2005-03-25 09:20:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1249252, 157422, 23053, '<td valign="top">Why would this shot convey boredom?  Don''t get me wrong - technically this shot is good, and if entered in a wildlife challenge, it could do well.   This gull looks angry and alert to me, not bored.</td>', 'Why would this shot convey boredom?  Don''t get me wrong - technically this shot is good, and if entered in a wildlife challenge, it could do well.   This gull looks angry and alert to me, not bored.', '2005-03-25 09:21:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1249254, 158844, 23053, '<td valign="top">Why would this shot convey boredom?  Don''t get me wrong - technically this shot is superb, and if entered in a wildlife challenge, it would do well.</td>', 'Why would this shot convey boredom?  Don''t get me wrong - technically this shot is superb, and if entered in a wildlife challenge, it would do well.', '2005-03-25 09:22:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1249258, 157890, 23053, '<td valign="top">Too bad you couldn''t get a shot of one of those hen-pecked husbands sitting drearily on a bench with many overfilled shopping bags all around him, just waiting for his wife to finish shopping while trying to stay awake.  The kid seems interested in the rides, not necessarily bored.  Also, the camera doesn''t seem focused on either the child or the rides.</td>', 'Too bad you couldn''t get a shot of one of those hen-pecked husbands sitting drearily on a bench with many overfilled shopping bags all around him, just waiting for his wife to finish shopping while trying to stay awake.  The kid seems interested in the rides, not necessarily bored.  Also, the camera doesn''t seem focused on either the child or the rides.', '2005-03-25 09:26:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1249263, 158868, 23053, '<td valign="top">I think this is Catbird''s image - either way.  I think there is too much dead space in this image...why couldn''t the clock be closer to the cat?  Also, there are image quality issues.  It''s hard to tell what the objects around the cat are supposed to be (I know that what the objects are doesn''t really matter, but that can be distracting, all the same - it looks like a bunny, a tree and either some poop or a mouse, one).  Of course this image was staged - it would have to be, and that''s no big deal.  The danger of staging is that when it''s just slightly off, it shows quite explicitly.</td>', 'I think this is Catbird''s image - either way.  I think there is too much dead space in this image...why couldn''t the clock be closer to the cat?  Also, there are image quality issues.  It''s hard to tell what the objects around the cat are supposed to be (I know that what the objects are doesn''t really matter, but that can be distracting, all the same - it looks like a bunny, a tree and either some poop or a mouse, one).  Of course this image was staged - it would have to be, and that''s no big deal.  The danger of staging is that when it''s just slightly off, it shows quite explicitly.', '2005-03-25 09:32:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1249266, 156877, 7364, '<td valign="top">Looks like 12:15 to me</td>', 'Looks like 12:15 to me', '2005-03-25 09:37:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1249268, 158885, 7364, '<td valign="top">Though you may get some comments to the contrary, I like the faded, yellowish colors.  It looks like a photo from the early 80s... and I know those pictures bore me!</td>', 'Though you may get some comments to the contrary, I like the faded, yellowish colors.  It looks like a photo from the early 80s... and I know those pictures bore me!', '2005-03-25 09:39:58.000000', NULL, 1),
