(1249422, 158406, 7033, '<td valign="top">He looks tired. Makes me think of hardship more than boredom. I wish I could see a bit more of his expression and in what context we are viewing him. (background, surroundings, etc)</td>', 'He looks tired. Makes me think of hardship more than boredom. I wish I could see a bit more of his expression and in what context we are viewing him. (background, surroundings, etc)', '2005-03-25 12:36:11.000000', NULL, 1),
