(1249425, 158180, 7033, '<td valign="top">Very nicely photographed. I like the lighting this. Almost wish I could see a face, but maybe that''s just me.  Some people may not like the reflection on the watch but I say it looks fine because watches often reflect that way  in real life. Good job.</td>', 'Very nicely photographed. I like the lighting this. Almost wish I could see a face, but maybe that''s just me.  Some people may not like the reflection on the watch but I say it looks fine because watches often reflect that way  in real life. Good job.', '2005-03-25 12:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1249426, 157138, 7033, '<td valign="top">This girl is beautiful and very interesting to photograph. I wish the background was simpler. Very good expression.</td>', 'This girl is beautiful and very interesting to photograph. I wish the background was simpler. Very good expression.', '2005-03-25 12:39:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1249429, 157392, 26679, '<td valign="top">You have used the screen as a light source well. The B&amp;W was a good choice as others who have tried this shot have resulted in a blue cast which does not look good.<br/> <br/>I feel a slightly tighter crop to position your face on the right hand thirds axis would help lift this to the next level. <br/> <br/>That being said this is still a well taken shot.</td>', 'You have used the screen as a light source well. The B&W was a good choice as others who have tried this shot have resulted in a blue cast which does not look good. I feel a slightly tighter crop to position your face on the right hand thirds axis would help lift this to the next level.  That being said this is still a well taken shot.', '2005-03-25 12:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1249431, 158715, 7033, '<td valign="top">Neat drawing. This could have been lit a bit better.</td>', 'Neat drawing. This could have been lit a bit better.', '2005-03-25 12:49:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1249432, 158963, 7033, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites so far. Interesting black and white choice. Love the composition of this photo. Good work.</td>', 'One of my favorites so far. Interesting black and white choice. Love the composition of this photo. Good work.', '2005-03-25 12:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1249433, 158120, 35448, '<td valign="top">Too much sharpness, makes it look flat and unreal. Nice shot otherwise.</td>', 'Too much sharpness, makes it look flat and unreal. Nice shot otherwise.', '2005-03-25 12:50:40.000000', NULL, 1),
