(1249435, 158006, 16488, '<td valign="top">The one on the left looks like she''s think, "Bored? Who''s bored?  I''m a guinea pig, I don''t get boooored." :)<br/> <br/>(Please note smiley.)<br/> <br/>Cute shot.</td>', 'The one on the left looks like she''s think, "Bored? Who''s bored?  I''m a guinea pig, I don''t get boooored." :) (Please note smiley.) Cute shot.', '2005-03-25 12:55:51.000000', NULL, 1),
