(1250744, 158812, 16488, '<td valign="top">Lovely yellow!  It would be nice to see one or both ends of the slug.  The cropping just carries the eye out of the picture.</td>', 'Lovely yellow!  It would be nice to see one or both ends of the slug.  The cropping just carries the eye out of the picture.', '2005-03-26 13:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1250746, 158975, 32117, '<td valign="top">nice image but outta cntxt</td>', 'nice image but outta cntxt', '2005-03-26 13:05:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1250747, 158886, 16488, '<td valign="top">The idea is there, but the overexposure really detracts.  Composition needed to shift left to avoid pulling the eye to the blank corner and to include the hand which is annoyingly cut off.</td>', 'The idea is there, but the overexposure really detracts.  Composition needed to shift left to avoid pulling the eye to the blank corner and to include the hand which is annoyingly cut off.', '2005-03-26 13:06:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1250748, 158895, 16488, '<td valign="top">The posture works.  I just can''t get past having everything out of focus.  It almost works as an abstraction...but just almost. (IMO)</td>', 'The posture works.  I just can''t get past having everything out of focus.  It almost works as an abstraction...but just almost. (IMO)', '2005-03-26 13:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1250752, 157048, 16488, '<td valign="top">Obsolescence does not necessarily equal boredom, I''m afraid.  I don''t understand your choice of composition--why so much empty black space?  And what are those dusty scratch-like things in the lower right corner above the mysterious red light?</td>', 'Obsolescence does not necessarily equal boredom, I''m afraid.  I don''t understand your choice of composition--why so much empty black space?  And what are those dusty scratch-like things in the lower right corner above the mysterious red light?', '2005-03-26 13:09:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1250753, 158156, 32117, '<td valign="top">keep it up!</td>', 'keep it up!', '2005-03-26 13:09:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1250754, 158587, 16488, '<td valign="top">Interesting study of motion.  It would be nice if the arm were sharp--perhaps if you had suspended it just above the records surface with the turntable rotating it would not have motion-blur as well.</td>', 'Interesting study of motion.  It would be nice if the arm were sharp--perhaps if you had suspended it just above the records surface with the turntable rotating it would not have motion-blur as well.', '2005-03-26 13:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1250757, 158976, 16488, '<td valign="top">The posture is right.  The B&amp;W is well rendered.  But without the pinniped''s mug showing it quickly loses my interest.</td>', 'The posture is right.  The B&W is well rendered.  But without the pinniped''s mug showing it quickly loses my interest.', '2005-03-26 13:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1250761, 158999, 16488, '<td valign="top">Bizarre post-processing!  It has a comic book flavor to it.  The weakes part of the image seems to me to be the overly-bright spot on the steering wheel--it just draws undue attention.</td>', 'Bizarre post-processing!  It has a comic book flavor to it.  The weakes part of the image seems to me to be the overly-bright spot on the steering wheel--it just draws undue attention.', '2005-03-26 13:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1250762, 156645, 16488, '<td valign="top">It is not immediately clear what is happening in this image.  I suppose that that gas pump-like nozzle dispenses liquer or some such.  The background objects look like hair styling products, especially with the inclusion of the flowers.  So...I guess I''m saying that the clutter detracts from your point.  (Besides, the subject is having too much fun to be truely bored, I think.)</td>', 'It is not immediately clear what is happening in this image.  I suppose that that gas pump-like nozzle dispenses liquer or some such.  The background objects look like hair styling products, especially with the inclusion of the flowers.  So...I guess I''m saying that the clutter detracts from your point.  (Besides, the subject is having too much fun to be truely bored, I think.)', '2005-03-26 13:21:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1250764, 158909, 34687, '<td valign="top">niceshot, but isit going with the theme</td>', 'niceshot, but isit going with the theme', '2005-03-26 13:22:10.000000', NULL, 1),
