(1250829, 156935, 28359, '<td valign="top">technically ok, a better skull would had been nice, might had tried some different compositions......5</td>', 'technically ok, a better skull would had been nice, might had tried some different compositions......5', '2005-03-26 14:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1250831, 158943, 16488, '<td valign="top">Colorful!  Opening the one kiss adds a nice touch.  The composition, however, is haphazard.  The open kiss draws interest, and then the eye falls out the corner of the pic--a different placement might avoid that.  The other kiss that draws the eye is the over-bright one near the upper left--a bit too hot, perhaps.  Finally, why not use the flag from the open kiss to advantage, smooth it out and use its lines to help lead the eye.</td>', 'Colorful!  Opening the one kiss adds a nice touch.  The composition, however, is haphazard.  The open kiss draws interest, and then the eye falls out the corner of the pic--a different placement might avoid that.  The other kiss that draws the eye is the over-bright one near the upper left--a bit too hot, perhaps.  Finally, why not use the flag from the open kiss to advantage, smooth it out and use its lines to help lead the eye.', '2005-03-26 14:05:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1250833, 158437, 28359, '<td valign="top">just wonder if this is B&amp;W with a green filter,,,I maybe way off..lol. either way nice .......6</td>', 'just wonder if this is B&W with a green filter,,,I maybe way off..lol. either way nice .......6', '2005-03-26 14:07:07.000000', NULL, 1);
