(1250865, 157385, 16488, '<td valign="top">You appear to be missing two tiles--with "e" and "d" you''d get 3 more points and a 50 point bonus for playing a seven letter word. :-)<br/> <br/>The lighting is interesting--really renders the subject well.  Limited DOF seems to play to your subject, but I''m not sure why you chose the "o" over the "f".  Then there''s the question of what kind of "board" or "bored" you were going for..... As I love Scrabble and play it with interest, I find your image''s statement puzzling.</td>', 'You appear to be missing two tiles--with "e" and "d" you''d get 3 more points and a 50 point bonus for playing a seven letter word. :-) The lighting is interesting--really renders the subject well.  Limited DOF seems to play to your subject, but I''m not sure why you chose the "o" over the "f".  Then there''s the question of what kind of "board" or "bored" you were going for..... As I love Scrabble and play it with interest, I find your image''s statement puzzling.', '2005-03-26 14:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
