(1250940, 158848, 16488, '<td valign="top">Games, puzzles and the like are interesting to me.  I recall a cousin of mine spending hours fascinated playing with his Rubix cube.  So, for me, the subject is not a good fit for the challenge.<br/>The photo itself has interest, however,  The limited DOF, the play of colors, the subtle reflections work well.  I think perhaps a square crop could add even more as there seems to be no good reason for the extra white space on either side.</td>', 'Games, puzzles and the like are interesting to me.  I recall a cousin of mine spending hours fascinated playing with his Rubix cube.  So, for me, the subject is not a good fit for the challenge.The photo itself has interest, however,  The limited DOF, the play of colors, the subtle reflections work well.  I think perhaps a square crop could add even more as there seems to be no good reason for the extra white space on either side.', '2005-03-26 15:12:45.000000', NULL, 1),
