(1252304, 158134, 34396, '<td valign="top">I like the photo, but it doesn''t say "bored" to me.  It might say "tired" or "weary" or "need help" but I don''t see bored.  I''m giving you 5 on the photo quality.</td>', 'I like the photo, but it doesn''t say "bored" to me.  It might say "tired" or "weary" or "need help" but I don''t see bored.  I''m giving you 5 on the photo quality.', '2005-03-27 12:25:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1252312, 158944, 34396, '<td valign="top">OK, a couple of primates sitting around sucking their thumbs could emote bored.  I''ll give you a 4 for getting out of the house to take the picture.  (I''m assuming you had to leave the house to take this!) ;-)  Re-evaluation:  I do see the boredom here.  I was being far too critical in my first go round.  I''m bumping to a 6, Answers challenge.  White wall is just a bit too bright for me.</td>', 'OK, a couple of primates sitting around sucking their thumbs could emote bored.  I''ll give you a 4 for getting out of the house to take the picture.  (I''m assuming you had to leave the house to take this!) ;-)  Re-evaluation:  I do see the boredom here.  I was being far too critical in my first go round.  I''m bumping to a 6, Answers challenge.  White wall is just a bit too bright for me.', '2005-03-27 12:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
