(1253041, 158082, 2333, '<td valign="top">Yeh, this one is a keeper. I''m not entirely sure this sez "bored" to me, but it is a great capture, and the treatment is nice as well.</td>', 'Yeh, this one is a keeper. I''m not entirely sure this sez "bored" to me, but it is a great capture, and the treatment is nice as well.', '2005-03-27 23:50:58.000000', NULL, 1),
