(1254934, 158503, 15330, '<td valign="top">I like that you took this photo from the side, and not the front. It would help if you could get the background more blurry, this will isolate your subject, and make that water bottle less distracting. I would also take the photo from a lower angle to give it a more interesting perspective.</td>', 'I like that you took this photo from the side, and not the front. It would help if you could get the background more blurry, this will isolate your subject, and make that water bottle less distracting. I would also take the photo from a lower angle to give it a more interesting perspective.', '2005-03-28 20:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
