(1255874, 157203, 35548, '<td valign="top">I have a tough time from this image believing that these people are bored.  There seems to be alot things in the photo that says different.  If anything they may be tired from a days shopping.  Also the distance from the lens to the subject makes it hard for me to identify with the subject.  Your title doesn''t win me over into believing that they are bored.</td>', 'I have a tough time from this image believing that these people are bored.  There seems to be alot things in the photo that says different.  If anything they may be tired from a days shopping.  Also the distance from the lens to the subject makes it hard for me to identify with the subject.  Your title doesn''t win me over into believing that they are bored.', '2005-03-29 08:17:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1255877, 156850, 35548, '<td valign="top">I think it is dangerous for the photographer to transfer his/her feelings of what an image should say based on his/her feelings without the image speaking strongely for itself.  You and I may feel bored at such ceremonies, but your image does not convey this message.  I do like the shot but I don''t feel that it says that these people or bored.</td>', 'I think it is dangerous for the photographer to transfer his/her feelings of what an image should say based on his/her feelings without the image speaking strongely for itself.  You and I may feel bored at such ceremonies, but your image does not convey this message.  I do like the shot but I don''t feel that it says that these people or bored.', '2005-03-29 08:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
