(1255885, 156819, 35548, '<td valign="top">I believe this person is more "wondering whats in the box" than bored  The image seems like you put alot of time into making a scene based on the Surviver tv show.<br/>The beach sand and palm tree may work in your favour but the blue wall destroys whatever the sand a tree does to the illusion of a Bore ship wreck surviver.  I think yyou were onto something and you should deserve credit for your thought process but I think you missed the mark of "Bored"</td>', 'I believe this person is more "wondering whats in the box" than bored  The image seems like you put alot of time into making a scene based on the Surviver tv show.The beach sand and palm tree may work in your favour but the blue wall destroys whatever the sand a tree does to the illusion of a Bore ship wreck surviver.  I think yyou were onto something and you should deserve credit for your thought process but I think you missed the mark of "Bored"', '2005-03-29 08:28:31.000000', NULL, 1),
