(1255917, 158076, 35548, '<td valign="top">I love this image it is far from boring because it has lots to look at. Much to busy (in a good way) to show "BORED"  I think photographers can be bored and take extremely interesting images that are Boring or show being bored.  If you were bore that doesn''t matter.  Your images needs to show being bored.<br/> <br/>Anyway...If this challenge was about machines.  I would rate it higher than what I rated it for this challenge.</td>', 'I love this image it is far from boring because it has lots to look at. Much to busy (in a good way) to show "BORED"  I think photographers can be bored and take extremely interesting images that are Boring or show being bored.  If you were bore that doesn''t matter.  Your images needs to show being bored. Anyway...If this challenge was about machines.  I would rate it higher than what I rated it for this challenge.', '2005-03-29 08:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
