(1256215, 157412, 32695, '<td valign="top">This is kindof neat.  I like the way you can barely see past the rain.  It looks neat.  The texture is awesome!  And the colors are bright behind the winow so they really come out.</td>', 'This is kindof neat.  I like the way you can barely see past the rain.  It looks neat.  The texture is awesome!  And the colors are bright behind the winow so they really come out.', '2005-03-29 11:16:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1256217, 157308, 32695, '<td valign="top">This is a very sharp image it looks very nice in black and white.  The texture of the ground, her clothes, her hair and the tire look great.  The shadow on the ground also looks very nice.  This can also be related to being bored because i remember doing these things when i was little.</td>', 'This is a very sharp image it looks very nice in black and white.  The texture of the ground, her clothes, her hair and the tire look great.  The shadow on the ground also looks very nice.  This can also be related to being bored because i remember doing these things when i was little.', '2005-03-29 11:18:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1256219, 158927, 32695, '<td valign="top">This is a neat picture because of the way the light is shining in on the couch and the texture and ripples of the couch look really good.</td>', 'This is a neat picture because of the way the light is shining in on the couch and the texture and ripples of the couch look really good.', '2005-03-29 11:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
