(1256480, 158535, 35235, '<td valign="top">yup . .try that with a kid not swinging just sitting with arms slumped down and you have a winner .. else it''s only a 9</td>', 'yup . .try that with a kid not swinging just sitting with arms slumped down and you have a winner .. else it''s only a 9', '2005-03-29 14:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1256492, 158937, 16488, '<td valign="top">Humorous!  I think this could be improved, however.  A more limited depth of field would have put the focus on your subject.  Waiting for the light to strike the face of the monument would have emphasized the letters and, perhaps, made the etching at the top of the monument more evident.  It also feels distorted, out of verticle--postprocessing with a perspective correction, or getting farther back with a longer focal length could change that.</td>', 'Humorous!  I think this could be improved, however.  A more limited depth of field would have put the focus on your subject.  Waiting for the light to strike the face of the monument would have emphasized the letters and, perhaps, made the etching at the top of the monument more evident.  It also feels distorted, out of verticle--postprocessing with a perspective correction, or getting farther back with a longer focal length could change that.', '2005-03-29 14:18:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1256496, 158890, 34985, '<td valign="top">I think that this is a well taken photo I am bumping he orginal 7 i gave it up to a 9 becauseit is better  than most of the competition as in that it is original.</td>', 'I think that this is a well taken photo I am bumping he orginal 7 i gave it up to a 9 becauseit is better  than most of the competition as in that it is original.', '2005-03-29 14:22:58.000000', NULL, 1),
