(1257142, 158996, 35548, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition.</td>', 'Interesting composition.', '2005-03-29 20:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1257212, 158790, 16488, '<td valign="top">What a hopeful cat!  Your picture reminds me of my all-time favorite pet "Max" -- ah such a time as waiting for us to appreciate their wonderful sense of humor, love and play.  (Bumping a point just for the fond memory you have evoked.)</td>', 'What a hopeful cat!  Your picture reminds me of my all-time favorite pet "Max" -- ah such a time as waiting for us to appreciate their wonderful sense of humor, love and play.  (Bumping a point just for the fond memory you have evoked.)', '2005-03-29 21:25:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1257214, 158842, 16488, '<td valign="top">Pattern in repetition--with the man as exclamation point!<br/>If you could have found the angle to straighten out the top row with the top of the frame--or managed to crop it so, it would be all the more perfect.  But, as is, a fine piece of work.  Bumping 2 points.</td>', 'Pattern in repetition--with the man as exclamation point!If you could have found the angle to straighten out the top row with the top of the frame--or managed to crop it so, it would be all the more perfect.  But, as is, a fine piece of work.  Bumping 2 points.', '2005-03-29 21:27:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1257219, 158883, 16488, '<td valign="top">Ho, hum, just another...<br/>NOT!<br/> <br/>Love the cat!  (A  little disturbed that it appears someone dressed the cat, but...one would have to be entirely bored to do so.)  Subtle, but effective. I''ll bet this works well as a larger piece.</td>', 'Ho, hum, just another...NOT! Love the cat!  (A  little disturbed that it appears someone dressed the cat, but...one would have to be entirely bored to do so.)  Subtle, but effective. I''ll bet this works well as a larger piece.', '2005-03-29 21:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1257222, 159005, 16488, '<td valign="top">This has the makings...almost.<br/>Your selective de-sat is right on.<br/>The extra saturation on the yellow, unfortunately, shows up badly on her feet.<br/>A little more room to the left.  A more level horizon.  Just a bit more (or less) of the plant at the top....<br/>So darn close!</td>', 'This has the makings...almost.Your selective de-sat is right on.The extra saturation on the yellow, unfortunately, shows up badly on her feet.A little more room to the left.  A more level horizon.  Just a bit more (or less) of the plant at the top....So darn close!', '2005-03-29 21:32:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1257224, 157308, 16488, '<td valign="top">Emotive! Lovely B&amp;W! Great detail!<br/>Can only suggest that it would be desirable to see the tips of the sneakers--I think they would help convey more attitude.<br/>bumping.</td>', 'Emotive! Lovely B&W! Great detail!Can only suggest that it would be desirable to see the tips of the sneakers--I think they would help convey more attitude.bumping.', '2005-03-29 21:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
