(1257615, 157583, 3214, '<td valign="top">Wow, 38 people thought this sucked and/or didn''t meet the theme of boring against 35 giving it 8 and over, certainly the most polarized opinions on one of my entries.  What a neat shape to the histogram!  ;-)<br/> <br/>Tech note for commenters.  Horses don''t puke--they physically can''t.  So when they have a stomach/intestinal blockage, it can be life and death, and gas colic incredibly uncomfortable.  They can certainly fart, which helps!</td>', 'Wow, 38 people thought this sucked and/or didn''t meet the theme of boring against 35 giving it 8 and over, certainly the most polarized opinions on one of my entries.  What a neat shape to the histogram!  ;-) Tech note for commenters.  Horses don''t puke--they physically can''t.  So when they have a stomach/intestinal blockage, it can be life and death, and gas colic incredibly uncomfortable.  They can certainly fart, which helps!', '2005-03-30 01:10:41.000000', NULL, 0),
