(1257737, 157342, 20056, '<td valign="top">Thanks everybody for the comments, I think this is one of my best photos ever...<br/>Idea was to compare the boredom of a book (yes, same chapters are!) and a beautiful painting when at the same time the boredom of the white color and the colorful painting<br/>The photo was taken in the bed to increase the tired feeling but I failed in showing more of the pillow...<br/>With advanced rule I would have cleaned some spots and reflexions...<br/>The light was located between the book and painting, I think is a nice lighting trick...<br/>Thanks again and I understand if I hurt some Irish''s feelings: it was not my intention (we have "el quijote" sometimes boring also :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-03-30 00:36:34.</i></td>', 'Thanks everybody for the comments, I think this is one of my best photos ever...Idea was to compare the boredom of a book (yes, same chapters are!) and a beautiful painting when at the same time the boredom of the white color and the colorful paintingThe photo was taken in the bed to increase the tired feeling but I failed in showing more of the pillow...With advanced rule I would have cleaned some spots and reflexions...The light was located between the book and painting, I think is a nice lighting trick...Thanks again and I understand if I hurt some Irish''s feelings: it was not my intention (we have "el quijote" sometimes boring also :)', '2005-03-30 01:32:53.000000', '2005-03-30 01:36:34.000000', 0),
(1257752, 157282, 33672, '<td valign="top">My 12 year old German Short hair is still Alive!  Thanks for the kind words and comments.  I have to figure out how to control the new olympus!</td>', 'My 12 year old German Short hair is still Alive!  Thanks for the kind words and comments.  I have to figure out how to control the new olympus!', '2005-03-30 01:35:27.000000', NULL, 0),
