(1257904, 156689, 31467, '<td valign="top">Sorry...I should have mentioned that Brody''s a "Jack Russell Pug" -- a mix between a Pug and a Jack Russell Terrier.  Hopefully that didn''t affect my rating at all...</td>', 'Sorry...I should have mentioned that Brody''s a "Jack Russell Pug" -- a mix between a Pug and a Jack Russell Terrier.  Hopefully that didn''t affect my rating at all...', '2005-03-30 02:12:44.000000', NULL, 0),
