(1257923, 157114, 93, '<td valign="top">Wow.. LOL.. I never expected to get 80%+ with a 5.4 in a million years.<br/> <br/>Thank you to everyone that commented.. enjoyed reading most of them.<br/> <br/>For those that commented that she didn''t really look bored, well.. we just have differing opinions on what boredom really is.  To me, frustration is very much a part of boredom.. it''s a continuation of boredom much of the time.  However, the "frustrated" look here was probably due to the fact that she was blowing her hair (a very, "I''m bored" thing to do), and looking up at it.  Curse the dark background for hiding the hair more than I wanted.  Don''t have a light background for a situation like this though, so had to do what I could.<br/> <br/>I think I also suffered from, "200 shots that looked almost exactly like this one" syndrome. LOL.. a lot of kids/people sitting with a "bored" look in this challenge.  Way to be original me!<br/> <br/>LOL<br/> <br/>Anyway.. 43rd place. Fantastic.  Sure beats 200+</td>', 'Wow.. LOL.. I never expected to get 80%+ with a 5.4 in a million years. Thank you to everyone that commented.. enjoyed reading most of them. For those that commented that she didn''t really look bored, well.. we just have differing opinions on what boredom really is.  To me, frustration is very much a part of boredom.. it''s a continuation of boredom much of the time.  However, the "frustrated" look here was probably due to the fact that she was blowing her hair (a very, "I''m bored" thing to do), and looking up at it.  Curse the dark background for hiding the hair more than I wanted.  Don''t have a light background for a situation like this though, so had to do what I could. I think I also suffered from, "200 shots that looked almost exactly like this one" syndrome. LOL.. a lot of kids/people sitting with a "bored" look in this challenge.  Way to be original me! LOL Anyway.. 43rd place. Fantastic.  Sure beats 200+', '2005-03-30 02:16:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(1257943, 157308, 29557, '<td valign="top">i knew it!</td>', 'i knew it!', '2005-03-30 02:23:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(1257947, 157227, 31637, '<td valign="top">Hey, great composition here and good placing!. I was one of your nines.</td>', 'Hey, great composition here and good placing!. I was one of your nines.', '2005-03-30 02:25:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(1257949, 158970, 31637, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition here. Like the color and lighting from sun. Love that parachute jump, I really gotta get to Coney Island before it opens!</td>', 'Very nice composition here. Like the color and lighting from sun. Love that parachute jump, I really gotta get to Coney Island before it opens!', '2005-03-30 02:27:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(1257970, 157271, 30857, '<td valign="top">I was sure this one was going to get the blue ribbon, I am sorry I was wrong. From the moment I saw it, I liked it. I gave it a straight 10 from the beginning. I was not surprised when later I saw it was yours, it has the same "feeling" as your "father and son" picture, they are alone in their own world.<br/> <br/>Congratulations for such a great picture :)</td>', 'I was sure this one was going to get the blue ribbon, I am sorry I was wrong. From the moment I saw it, I liked it. I gave it a straight 10 from the beginning. I was not surprised when later I saw it was yours, it has the same "feeling" as your "father and son" picture, they are alone in their own world. Congratulations for such a great picture :)', '2005-03-30 02:32:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(1257973, 157392, 26679, '<td valign="top">Congratulation on your top 20 finish.<br/>Not bad for your first challenge. Keep it up...</td>', 'Congratulation on your top 20 finish.Not bad for your first challenge. Keep it up...', '2005-03-30 02:33:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(1257985, 158156, 31637, '<td valign="top">I was babysitting my cousins and we were browsing DPC. I liked this and it also made the kids laugh! Mainly at the title, I would pick you to do my self portrait anyday. You are really unique and have created your own style..keep it up!</td>', 'I was babysitting my cousins and we were browsing DPC. I liked this and it also made the kids laugh! Mainly at the title, I would pick you to do my self portrait anyday. You are really unique and have created your own style..keep it up!', '2005-03-30 02:36:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(1257992, 158404, 31049, '<td valign="top">Strange... I personally believe this should have at least entered the top ten. If only the eyes were sharp...</td>', 'Strange... I personally believe this should have at least entered the top ten. If only the eyes were sharp...', '2005-03-30 02:37:33.000000', NULL, 0),
