(1258099, 157129, 34563, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by metoecus:</b></div><hr/><i> The background is needlessly busy; a shallower DOF would have made this a cleaner shot. The b&amp;w and grainy texture was a nice choice, as was the all-black attire. The sloppily-worn hat conveys a sense of ennui, but the facial expression seems more staged than sincere. The chin-in-hand pose does convey boredom, but it''s rather trite; since you don''t re-introduce interest by shooting it from a novel angle or anything, it''s roughly as interesting and original as a frowning face in a "sadness" themed challenge. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Actually , your comment is helpful, but one precision : it wasn''t staged at all !</td>', 'Originally posted by metoecus: The background is needlessly busy; a shallower DOF would have made this a cleaner shot. The b&w and grainy texture was a nice choice, as was the all-black attire. The sloppily-worn hat conveys a sense of ennui, but the facial expression seems more staged than sincere. The chin-in-hand pose does convey boredom, but it''s rather trite; since you don''t re-introduce interest by shooting it from a novel angle or anything, it''s roughly as interesting and original as a frowning face in a "sadness" themed challenge.   Actually , your comment is helpful, but one precision : it wasn''t staged at all !', '2005-03-30 03:20:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(1258142, 157583, 19708, '<td valign="top">What a great picture.<br/>I can''t help but to smile when I see this.<br/>A bit left field for bored, but still a great shot regardless!<br/></td>', 'What a great picture.I can''t help but to smile when I see this.A bit left field for bored, but still a great shot regardless!', '2005-03-30 03:49:15.000000', NULL, 0),
