(1258155, 156691, 34985, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for commenting. I hope to learn something. I know this was not a strong photo it was only my 2ns submission ever so I was hasty. Thank you.<br/> <br/>mandy</td>', 'Thank you all for commenting. I hope to learn something. I know this was not a strong photo it was only my 2ns submission ever so I was hasty. Thank you. mandy', '2005-03-30 04:05:27.000000', NULL, 0),
