(1258226, 158880, 1570, '<td valign="top">thanks a lot for your comments! yes, the thing with the glass was intentional, i didn''t think there''d be any questions about that...</td>', 'thanks a lot for your comments! yes, the thing with the glass was intentional, i didn''t think there''d be any questions about that...', '2005-03-30 05:06:47.000000', NULL, 0),
