(1258247, 158895, 35044, '<td valign="top">I really liked this - gave you a 7 (same as I gave for each of the ribbons).  Thought you captured a "glazed" mood - unfortunate that some do not appear to have realised that an out of focus shot can be intentionally done for effect (as I think you have done here).  <br/> <br/>I think that a hard focus would have made it a normal, uninteresting shot, and as for soft focus.... bleurgh!</td>', 'I really liked this - gave you a 7 (same as I gave for each of the ribbons).  Thought you captured a "glazed" mood - unfortunate that some do not appear to have realised that an out of focus shot can be intentionally done for effect (as I think you have done here).   I think that a hard focus would have made it a normal, uninteresting shot, and as for soft focus.... bleurgh!', '2005-03-30 05:35:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(1258249, 158502, 9581, '<td valign="top">Awesome use with  the macro feature that the fugi 3100  has... This is a good photo and good composition too. Nice lighting as well.. Welcome aboard to Dpc look forward to seeing  more pictures you take...</td>', 'Awesome use with  the macro feature that the fugi 3100  has... This is a good photo and good composition too. Nice lighting as well.. Welcome aboard to Dpc look forward to seeing  more pictures you take...', '2005-03-30 05:37:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(1258250, 157308, 27399, '<td valign="top">This was without a doubt the best photo in the challenge.  Why anyone would give you a 2 or a 3 on this is beyond me (or anything below a ten for that matter).  It was a great shot and candidly captured boredom, good job and congratulations!</td>', 'This was without a doubt the best photo in the challenge.  Why anyone would give you a 2 or a 3 on this is beyond me (or anything below a ten for that matter).  It was a great shot and candidly captured boredom, good job and congratulations!', '2005-03-30 05:37:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(1258255, 158790, 29858, '<td valign="top">The final score on this just anger''s me.  This shot was excellent, and 1 of only 2 10 I gave out.  You should have placed MUCH higher in this challenge....stupid voters!!  Grrr.<br/> <br/>L8r,</td>', 'The final score on this just anger''s me.  This shot was excellent, and 1 of only 2 10 I gave out.  You should have placed MUCH higher in this challenge....stupid voters!!  Grrr. L8r,', '2005-03-30 05:41:31.000000', NULL, 0),
