(1260802, 157011, 30457, '<td valign="top">Four challenges , two in the top twenty. I''m happy. Thank you for all the comments and votes.This shot was taken with a diffrent set-up intended. My girls actually got bored while I was trying to set-up the shot so I took this snapshot of them .</td>', 'Four challenges , two in the top twenty. I''m happy. Thank you for all the comments and votes.This shot was taken with a diffrent set-up intended. My girls actually got bored while I was trying to set-up the shot so I took this snapshot of them .', '2005-03-31 00:34:50.000000', NULL, 0),
