(1261520, 158842, 714, '<td valign="top">The lines, shadows and lighting are awesome in this shot.  YOu did an excellent job of capture the Bored look.  Congrats!</td>', 'The lines, shadows and lighting are awesome in this shot.  YOu did an excellent job of capture the Bored look.  Congrats!', '2005-03-31 11:17:19.000000', NULL, 0),
