(1266341, 157347, 35149, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by seriocomic:</b></div><hr/><i> Nice candid, good use of B/W, a little blt blurry, try higher ISO with faster shutter next time if your camera allows. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>The picture is actually in perfect focus I must have done something wrong in resize for the upload - ihave it blown up to poster size in my house and it looks perfect - but i do see where this copy looks blurry my first try hopefully next time i''ll get it right ;-)</td>', 'Originally posted by seriocomic: Nice candid, good use of B/W, a little blt blurry, try higher ISO with faster shutter next time if your camera allows.  The picture is actually in perfect focus I must have done something wrong in resize for the upload - ihave it blown up to poster size in my house and it looks perfect - but i do see where this copy looks blurry my first try hopefully next time i''ll get it right ;-)', '2005-04-02 17:44:39.000000', NULL, 0),
