(1337983, 158882, 24128, '<td valign="top">I''ve just noticed this image (I didn''t vote on this challenge), this is a great image, sharp, well exposed and very suited to B/W conversion.<br/> <br/>I could not understand how this could have scored so low, then I stood up - I''m looking at this image on an LCD screen, from where I was sitting the background is a pure black, as I stand up I can see various shades of grey in the background - the background really needs to be pure black. That said it deserves something like a 5.5 average as is (and a 6+ with a solid background)</td>', 'I''ve just noticed this image (I didn''t vote on this challenge), this is a great image, sharp, well exposed and very suited to B/W conversion. I could not understand how this could have scored so low, then I stood up - I''m looking at this image on an LCD screen, from where I was sitting the background is a pure black, as I stand up I can see various shades of grey in the background - the background really needs to be pure black. That said it deserves something like a 5.5 average as is (and a 6+ with a solid background)', '2005-04-28 13:59:47.000000', NULL, 0),
