(1402642, 158488, 6349, '<td valign="top">I like this very much.  I find myself often using myself as a model and I think it''s a good idea.  It helps you learn to capture a bit of yourself in an image which will help you when photographing other people.  You did a good job with this.  I don''t mind the clutter as it seems organic and ads to the realness of the scene.</td>', 'I like this very much.  I find myself often using myself as a model and I think it''s a good idea.  It helps you learn to capture a bit of yourself in an image which will help you when photographing other people.  You did a good job with this.  I don''t mind the clutter as it seems organic and ads to the realness of the scene.', '2005-05-21 17:30:22.000000', NULL, 0),
