(1509639, 158488, 10432, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot - fits the Bored theme well.<br/> <br/>The tones are very nice.  I can just feel the energy drain out of me while looking at the main subject draped over the couch.  The background is a bit busy for my taste.  But I like how you kept half your face shadowed.  Congrats on the high placement!</td>', 'This is a great shot - fits the Bored theme well. The tones are very nice.  I can just feel the energy drain out of me while looking at the main subject draped over the couch.  The background is a bit busy for my taste.  But I like how you kept half your face shadowed.  Congrats on the high placement!', '2005-07-06 01:06:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(1545547, 157347, 27164, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Photoholic:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by seriocomic:</b></div><hr/><i> Nice candid, good use of B/W, a little blt blurry, try higher ISO with faster shutter next time if your camera allows. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>The picture is actually in perfect focus I must have done something wrong in resize for the upload - ihave it blown up to poster size in my house and it looks perfect - but i do see where this copy looks blurry my first try hopefully next time i''ll get it right ;-) </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Maybe some USM would help get the photo sharper?</td>', 'Originally posted by Photoholic: Originally posted by seriocomic: Nice candid, good use of B/W, a little blt blurry, try higher ISO with faster shutter next time if your camera allows.  The picture is actually in perfect focus I must have done something wrong in resize for the upload - ihave it blown up to poster size in my house and it looks perfect - but i do see where this copy looks blurry my first try hopefully next time i''ll get it right ;-)  Maybe some USM would help get the photo sharper?', '2005-07-19 03:41:39.000000', NULL, 0),
