(1907321, 157308, 24500, '<td valign="top">Phil thinks this is "a pretty good photo" and he would like to see it in full color.  I wonder if you captured this image in color and changed it to black and white during editing?  If so, we can consider buying a copy from you in the DCPrints. This would be an experiment for the very first time ever.  Get back to us please and keep on shooting great photos.  From one of your favorite group of fans.  by Donald</td>', 'Phil thinks this is "a pretty good photo" and he would like to see it in full color.  I wonder if you captured this image in color and changed it to black and white during editing?  If so, we can consider buying a copy from you in the DCPrints. This would be an experiment for the very first time ever.  Get back to us please and keep on shooting great photos.  From one of your favorite group of fans.  by Donald', '2005-11-30 11:01:12.000000', NULL, 0),
